    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/aot/BeanRegistrationAotProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.aot\"><code>BeanRegistrationAotProcessor</code></a> handling <a href=\"#getModuleIdentifier()\"><code>module</code></a> <a href=\"../domain/ManagedTypes.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>ManagedTypes</code></a> instances.\nThis AOT processor allows store specific handling of discovered types to be registered.",
      "translation": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/aot/BeanRegistrationAotProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.aot\"><code>BeanRegistrationAotProcessor</code></a> 处理 <a href=\"#getModuleIdentifier()\"><code>module</code></a> 中的 <a href=\"../domain/ManagedTypes.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>ManagedTypes</code></a> 实例。该 AOT 处理器允许注册对发现的类型的特定处理方式。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Hook to provide a customized flavor of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/aot/BeanRegistrationAotContribution.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.aot\"><code>BeanRegistrationAotContribution</code></a>. By overriding this method calls to\n<a href=\"#registerTypeHints(org.springframework.core.ResolvableType,org.springframework.data.aot.AotContext,org.springframework.aot.generate.GenerationContext)\"><code>registerTypeHints(ResolvableType, AotContext, GenerationContext)</code></a> might no longer be issued.",
      "translation": "钩子用于提供对 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/aot/BeanRegistrationAotContribution.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.aot\"><code>BeanRegistrationAotContribution</code></a> 的自定义风味。通过重写此方法，可能不再发出对\n<a href=\"#registerTypeHints(org.springframework.core.ResolvableType,org.springframework.data.aot.AotContext,org.springframework.aot.generate.GenerationContext)\"><code>registerTypeHints(ResolvableType, AotContext, GenerationContext)</code></a> 的调用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Hook to provide a customized flavor of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/aot/BeanRegistrationAotContribution.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.aot\"><code>BeanRegistrationAotContribution</code></a>.",
