      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/aot/BeanRegistrationAotProcessor.html#processAheadOfTime(org.springframework.beans.factory.support.RegisteredBean)\" title=\"org.springframework.beans.factory.aot 中的类或接口\">processAheadOfTime</a></code> 是接口 <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/aot/BeanRegistrationAotProcessor.html\" title=\"org.springframework.beans.factory.aot 中的类或接口\">BeanRegistrationAotProcessor</a></code> 中的一个方法。",
      "count": 1
